{
  "id": "E179",
  "title": "What’s Your Plan for Christmas?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-12-19",
  "synopsis": "Why is Jay working so hard?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/609/cbb4a035d4bf361273508c768ccd0c694b800ea5.mp3?1513502893",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你圣诞节有什么打算？\n\n朋友：杰杰，好久不见，你最近怎么样？\n杰杰：我最近常常去广州出差，昨天刚回来。\n朋友：你好像很忙，是不是工作特别多？\n杰杰：没错，年底总是一年中最忙的时候。\n朋友：虽然工作很忙，可是你也要多休息啊。\n杰杰：谢谢你的关心。我想现在多做点，这样圣诞节和新年可以多请几天假。\n朋友：你圣诞节有什么打算？\n杰杰：我要回美国陪我父母过圣诞节，然后跟朋友们一起过新年。",
    "traditional": "你聖誕節有什麼打算？\n\n朋友：杰杰，好久不見，你最近怎麼樣？\n杰杰：我最近常常去廣州出差，昨天剛回來。\n朋友：你好像很忙，是不是工作特別多？\n杰杰：沒錯，年底總是一年中最忙的時候。\n朋友：雖然工作很忙，可是你也要多休息啊。\n杰杰：謝謝你的關心。我想現在多做點，這樣聖誕節和新年可以多請幾天假。\n朋友：你聖誕節有什麼打算？\n杰杰：我要回美國陪我父母過聖誕節，然後跟朋友們一起過新年。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What’s your plan for Christmas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "朋友：杰杰，好久不见，你最近怎么样？",
      "traditional": "朋友：杰杰，好久不見，你最近怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "péng you jié jié hǎo jiǔ bu jiàn nǐ zuì jìn zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Friend: Jay, long time no see. How are you doing recently?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "杰杰：我最近常常去广州出差，昨天刚回来。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：我最近常常去廣州出差，昨天剛回來。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié wǒ zuì jìn cháng cháng qù guǎng zhōu chū chāi zuó tiān gāng huí lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: These days I often go to Guangzhou for business. I just came back yesterday."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "朋友：你好像很忙，是不是工作特别多？",
      "traditional": "朋友：你好像很忙，是不是工作特別多？",
      "pinyin": "péng you nǐ hǎo xiàng hěn máng shì bu shì gōng zuò tè bié duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Friend: You look quite busy. Do you have a lot of work?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "杰杰：没错，年底总是一年中最忙的时候。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：沒錯，年底總是一年中最忙的時候。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié méi cuò nián dǐ zǒng shì yì nián zhōng zuì máng de shí hou",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: Yeah, the end of the year is always the busiest time."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "朋友：虽然工作很忙，可是你也要多休息啊。",
      "traditional": "朋友：雖然工作很忙，可是你也要多休息啊。",
      "pinyin": "péng you suī rán gōng zuò hěn máng kě shì nǐ yě yào duō xiū xi a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Friend: Even though you are busy, you need to rest more."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "杰杰：谢谢你的关心。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：謝謝你的關心。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié xiè xie nǐ de guān xīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "我想现在多做点，这样圣诞节和新年可以多请几天假。",
      "traditional": "我想現在多做點，這樣聖誕節和新年可以多請幾天假。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng xiàn zài duō zuò diǎn zhè yàng shèng dàn jié hé xīn nián kě yǐ duō qǐng jǐ tiān jià",
      "english": "Jay: Thank you for your concern."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I want to work hard now, and then take a few days extra leave during Christmas and New Year."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "朋友：你圣诞节有什么打算？",
      "traditional": "朋友：你聖誕節有什麼打算？",
      "pinyin": "péng you nǐ shèng dàn jié yǒu shén me dǎ suàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Friend: What’s your plan for Christmas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "杰杰：我要回美国陪我父母过圣诞节，然后跟朋友们一起过新年。",
      "traditional": "杰杰：我要回美國陪我父母過聖誕節，然後跟朋友們一起過新年。",
      "pinyin": "jié jié wǒ yào huí měi guó péi wǒ fù mǔ guò shèng dàn jié rán hòu gēn péng you men yì qǐ guò xīn nián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Jay: I’m going back to the U.S. to spend Christmas with my parents, and then celebrate New Year's with my friends."
    }
